# GSD protocols (optional)

When the user runs GSD workflows (`gsd-plan`, `gsd-execute`, `gsd-progress`, etc.):

- Prefer files under `.planning/` as source of truth (`STATE.md`, and future `PROJECT.md` / `ROADMAP.md`).
- Keep phase handoffs in `STATE.md`: what exists, what passed, gaps, next.
- Do not invent School ERP fee/ledger requirements into FindState.
